  <text>
      <body>
         <entry xml:id="savana-dlgenr"
            xml:lang="en"
            type="mainEntry"
            prev="#"
            next="#"
            source="Genesis Rabbah">
            <form type="lemma" opt="false">
               <orth type="lemma" xml:lang="jpa" opt="false" select="true">סבני</orth>
               <orth type="transliteration" xml:lang="fjb" opt="false">swbny</orth>
               <pron notation="rabbinic" opt="false">savne</pron>
               <gramGrp>
                  <gram type="pos">noun</gram>
                  <gram type="gen">f.</gram>
               </gramGrp>
               <form type="variant">
                  <orth type="variant" xml:lang="jpa">סובני</orth>
                  <orth type="transliteration" xml:lang="fjb">swbny</orth>
                  <pron notation="rabbinic">suvne</pron>
               </form>
            </form>
            <sense xml:id="savana-dlgenr-1">
               <cit type="translation" xml:lang="en" subtype="sense">
                  <quote>linen cloth used as head covering</quote>
               </cit>
               <cit type="translationEquivalent" xml:lang="grc">
                  <quote>σάβανον</quote>
               </cit>
               <cit type="example" xml:lang="jpa">
                  <quote>ויעשו להם חגורות אמר ר' אבא בר כהנא אין כת' חגורה אלא חגורות חגור חגירי חגורות איסטכיון גולין סדינים, כשם שעושין לאיש כך עושין לאשה צוצלין קולוסין 
                     <app>
                        <lem>סבכין</lem>
                        <rdg wit="#Vat2">סבוון</rdg>
                     </app>.</quote>
                  <bibl>
                     <ref type="witness">19,6</ref>
                     <ref type="witness">I 176: 1</ref>
                  </bibl>
                  <ref type="entry" xml:lang="jpa">קולוסין</ref>
                  <ref type="entry" xml:lang="jpa">איסטכיון</ref>
                  <note>= <bibl type="ancient">Yalq 27 [I 93: 44]</bibl> (<term xml:lang="jpa">סבכיון</term>)</note>
               </cit>
            </sense>
            <note>Emendation the GenR-reading acc. to <bibl type="modern">AC VII 10b</bibl>, <bibl type="modern">Krauss, LW II 373a</bibl>. The Gr. etymology is represented also by <bibl type="modern">Levy III 468b-469a</bibl>. However, Löw (in Krauss ibid.) and <bibl type="modern">Sokoloff, DJPA 408a</bibl>, reject the Gr. etymology. Cf. also <bibl type="modern">Jastrow II 951a</bibl>. For <term xml:lang="jpa">סבך</term> “hair net” cf. <bibl type="modern">Sokoloff, DJPA 407b</bibl>.</note>
            <ref type="bibliography">
               <bibl>
                  <title>Sokoloff, DJPA</title>
                  <citedRange>408a</citedRange></bibl>
               <bibl>
                  <title>Krauss, LW II</title>
                  <citedRange>373ab</citedRange></bibl>
            </ref>
         </entry>
